Package: inflascope
Title: Rural and Urban Inflation Intelligence for India
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("INFLASCOPE", "Contributors", email = "maintainers@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An offline-first analytical toolkit and interactive Shiny interface
    for official Indian consumer price indices and household expenditure
    benchmarks. Separates observed data from hypothetical household scenarios.
